			"notes": "### Features\n- Enhanced Player List compat: gated on EPL actually being present, renders pronouns next to names in its panel\n- Modrinth project description now synced from the README on every publish\n- Pronoun codes and the \"Loading...\" placeholder are now translated (EN/FR) instead of shown as raw English\n- New /wyp refresh command — forces a re-fetch of all cached pronouns\n- New join-time reminder for players with no PronounDB pronoun set, with /wyp hint and /wyp hint hide\n\n### Fixes\n- EPL detection no longer loads its mixin target class\n- Guarded, then properly fixed via batching, the offline-player pronoun-fetch flood in EPL's panel (offline players are now included safely)\n- Release tag must now exactly match mod_version — no more \"v\" prefix stripping\n\n### Docs\n- README split into Modrinth-facing and GitHub-facing sources, merged into a generated README.md\n\n### CI\n- README.md auto-regenerates when its sources change\n- Release workflow verifies (and auto-corrects) mod_version against the release tag\n\n### Build\n- Enhanced Player List compat dependency wired up\n\n### Chore\n- EPL compat wiring tidied after review"
		},
